Model:
    int: x 1
    x: x + 1
    int: y 4
    x: x + 1
end: Model

Later:
    int: pad 2
    int: x 3
    x: x + 10
end: Later

R: merge: Model Later
if: R\x != 3 || R\y != 4 || R\pad != 2
    sendMessage: exit(exit_code: 81; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
    return
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: 7; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
